Error: Jet.RangeDirectionMismatch: This range counts down from 10 to 1 but has no step
  --> Tests/UI/range_backward_constant.jet:4:15
    |
  4 |     loop i in 10..1 { print(i) }
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: A range without a step counts up, so `10..1` would run zero times
 Fix: Add the minus step: `10..1, -1`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.RangeDirectionMismatch

Error: Jet.RangeDirectionMismatch: This range counts up from 1 to 10 but its step -2 counts down
  --> Tests/UI/range_backward_constant.jet:5:22
    |
  5 |     loop j in 1..10, -2 { print(j) }
    |                      ^^
 Why: A negative step moves away from 10, so the loop would run zero times
 Fix: Make the step positive: `1..10, 2`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.RangeDirectionMismatch
